h names the file twice (comment + pytest arm) and test_gate_arm_runs_this_file passes. Instrument trail, both published: 9b54a0ca is an ENVIRONMENT red (tests arm aborted \"ERROR: DuckBrain URL missing\" in 4.5 min with tier2 already COMPLETE 6/6) and a7697111 is an ENVIRONMENT red (python3 from PATH could not import pytest -> \"SKIPPED [pytest] ... NOT run, NOT passed\" -> required-arm policy failed in 69s); the third run carried the venv on PATH plus DUCKBRAIN_URL/DUCKBRAIN_API_KEY and the real 821.94s gate passed. No check was weakened and .gitreins/config.yaml was not edited (per-process GITREINS_MAX_ITERATIONS=400 / GITREINS_MAX_INPUT_TOKENS=8M only). Was guard=SKIP / ci=SKIP with no verdict; this run is the commit-bound verdict the AUG-154 debt row asks for.", "worktree": "/home/kara/proj-wt-auger-xml-hardening", "branch": "wt/auger-xml-hardening", "worker_summary": "AUG-125 CLOSED on a judged GitReins PASS bound to 7188bd7 (run 5c0158a1): tier1 lint+secrets+tests PASS with a REAL bash tests/gate.sh (717 passed / 2 skipped in 821.94s, GATE PASS, LIVE ARMS ran 2 skipped 0), tier2 COMPLETE 11/11 (6 authored + 5 derived). Implementation commit 4481afb is an ancestor of the judged HEAD.", "evidence_run_id": "5c0158a1"}
